      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我希望能得到点刺激！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n一种能激发我的灵感，\n由变化引起的刺激……那就是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562115E0C671B80FD5F97523070B9523A6FC0FF0100100001BE01000A4E0079CD80FD6FC053D1621176847075611FFF0C000A753153D853165F158D777684523A6FC02026202690A35C31662F2026202600100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超级进化！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857EA78FDB5316FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由超级进化产生的变化！\n我想看由超级进化带来的力量提升！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75318D857EA78FDB53164EA7751F768453D85316FF01000A621160F3770B75318D857EA78FDB53165E2667657684529B91CF63D05347FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我尤其想看超级喷火驼的爆发！\n希望自己也能从中得到一些灵感！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C24517660F3770B8D857EA755B7706B9A7C7684720653D1FF01000A5E0C671B81EA5DF14E5F80FD4ECE4E2D5F9752304E004E9B7075611FFF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此想拜托你！跟我来一场对战，\n让我看看超级喷火驼吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B6460F362DC62584F60FF018DDF621167654E00573A5BF96218FF0C000A8BA96211770B770B8D857EA755B7706B9A7C5427FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
